@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Deterministic multi-file CPG composition and import evidence

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #495057
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F1F3F5
  BorderColor #495057
}

component "File CPG 0\nlocal NodeId space" as F0 #DBE4FF
component "File CPG 1\nlocal NodeId space" as F1 #DBE4FF
component "File CPG n\nlocal NodeId space" as FN #DBE4FF
component "merge_programs\ninput-file order" as MERGE #F1F3F5
component "merge_from\nsorted source NodeId\nfresh node and edge ids" as REMAP #FFF3BF
component "ProgramCpg\none shared node set\nFileScope partitions" as PROGRAM #D3F9D8
component "build_import_graph\nlongest unique alias" as IMPORT #FFE8CC
component "ImportGraph\nexact / ambiguous / external" as EVIDENCE #E5DBFF
component "Imports / Exports\ntyped overlay edges" as OVERLAY #FFE8CC
component "resolve_calls\nExactViaImport" as CALLS #C3FAE8

F0 --> MERGE
F1 --> MERGE
FN --> MERGE
MERGE --> REMAP : each file
REMAP --> PROGRAM : translated nodes, edges,\nmetadata, embedded references
PROGRAM --> IMPORT : file roots, paths,\nmodules, declarations
IMPORT --> EVIDENCE : every import statement
IMPORT --> OVERLAY : unique matches only
OVERLAY --> PROGRAM : append-only
PROGRAM --> CALLS : declaration-level\nimport evidence

note right of REMAP
  parent, children, Call.target,
  Identifier.definition, and
  Lambda.captures are translated.
  Unmapped references are cleared.
end note

note right of IMPORT
  A tie emits no dependency edge.
  Declaration edges carry the local
  binding, including explicit renames.
  Re-running adds zero duplicate
  Imports or Exports edges.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF>| per-file syntax and overlays |
|<#FFF3BF>| identifier translation |
|<#D3F9D8>| unified program CPG |
|<#FFE8CC>| import/export topology |
|<#E5DBFF>| out-of-graph evidence |
|<#C3FAE8>| uniquely supported call topology |
|<#F1F3F5>| deterministic orchestration |
endlegend
@enduml
